---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Tamio Terms of Use — Oksyderkeis" description="Terms of use for the Tamio personal finance app.">
  <main class="px-5 py-16 max-w-3xl mx-auto prose prose-invert">
    <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> August 8, 2026</p>

    <p>
      By using Tamio, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, stop using the app.
    </p>

    <h2>1. What Tamio Is</h2>
    <p>
      Tamio is a personal finance organization app. It helps you log expenses, track budgets and investments,
      manage shopping items, and organize coupons and related reminders.
    </p>

    <h2>2. No Financial Advice</h2>
    <p>
      Tamio is an organization tool, not an investment advisor. Anything shown in the app is for tracking and planning only.
      You remain fully responsible for your own financial decisions.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Your Account</h2>
    <p>
      You are responsible for your sign-in credentials and for the accuracy of the data you choose to enter into the app.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Subscriptions and Premium Features</h2>
    <p>
      Some features may be offered as paid upgrades in the future through Apple App Store or Google Play.
      Pricing, billing, cancellation, and refunds for in-app subscriptions are governed by the rules of the platform where you purchase them.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Acceptable Use</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Do not attempt unauthorized access to Tamio systems or other users' data.</li>
      <li>Do not misuse the app for unlawful activity.</li>
      <li>Do not resell or copy the app without permission.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>6. Data and Deletion</h2>
    <p>
      You keep ownership of the data you enter. You can request deletion, and Tamio also provides an in-app account deletion flow.
      For full data-handling details, see the <a href="/tamio/privacy">Tamio Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Service Availability</h2>
    <p>
      Tamio is provided as-is. We try to keep it available and secure, but we cannot guarantee uninterrupted service at all times.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For questions about these terms, contact:<br />
      <strong>david@oksyderkeis.net</strong>
    </p>
  </main>
</Base>

<style is:global>
  .prose {
    --tw-prose-body: var(--color-ink-100);
    --tw-prose-headings: var(--color-gold-400);
    --tw-prose-links: var(--color-gold-400);
    --tw-prose-bold: var(--color-ink-100);
    --tw-prose-code: var(--color-gold-400);
  }
</style>
